type: software
title: "Ganges Delta SOC: code and data"
abstract: "Code and data reproducing every reported number, table and figure of the Ganges Delta soil organic carbon manuscript (Hasan et al.), including geochemical predictability tests, leak-free spatial cross-validation, the process model, and cross-delta transferability analyses."
